    "q-80516": {
      "dom_id": "step-q80516",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Which of the following gives the value of the double integral ${∬}_{R}{x}^{2}{y}^{3}\\text{ }{e}^{2x-y}\\,\\text{d}A$ over the rectangle $R=[0,1]\\times [2,5]?$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the multiplicative property of double integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}{x}^{2}{y}^{3}\\text{ }{e}^{2x-y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{R}({x}^{2}\\,{e}^{2x})(\\frac{{y}^{3}}{{e}^{y}})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =({\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\,{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{2}^{5}\\frac{{y}^{3}}{{e}^{y}}\\,\\text{d}y)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-80516-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "({\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{2}^{5}{y}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y)",
