    "q-80517": {
      "dom_id": "step-q80517",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which of the following gives the value of the double integral ${∬}_{R}\\sqrt{xy}\\text{ }\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}A$ over the rectangle $R=[0,5]\\times [3,7]?$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the multiplicative property of double integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}\\sqrt{xy}\\text{ }\\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{R}{x}^{1/2}\\,{y}^{1/2}\\,{y}^{-1}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{R}({x}^{1/2})\\text{ }({y}^{-1/2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =({\\int }_{0}^{5}\\sqrt{x}\\,\\text{d}x)({\\int }_{3}^{7}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{y}}\\,\\text{d}y)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
